---
name: create-pr
description: Create an intent-driven pull request for {{PROJECT_NAME}}: extracts the problem statement, validates the diff against it, links the ticket, targets {{DEFAULT_BRANCH}}. Use for any PR creation; a hook redirects raw `gh pr create` here.
user_invocable: true
